IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. AUDITPOST.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
SELECT AUDIT-FILE ASSIGN TO 'AUDITLF'.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD AUDIT-FILE.
01 AUDITREC.
   05 AUDITKEY PIC 9(6).
   05 AUDITAMT PIC 9(7)V99.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 INPUTREC.
   05 INPUTKEY PIC 9(6).
   05 INPUTBAL PIC 9(7)V99.
   05 INPUTSTAT PIC X.
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING INPUTREC.
MAIN.
MOVE INPUTKEY TO AUDITKEY.
MOVE INPUTBAL TO AUDITAMT.
WRITE AUDITREC.
GOBACK.
